OL,3,AFrance halts use of stun grenades after
OL,4,Aboy's hand blown off in student
OL,5,Aprotests
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Sebastien Lecornu has
OL,8,Fdefended the police response, after
OL,9,Fseveral groups complained of police
OL,10,Fusing disproportionate force towards
OL,11,Fteenagers.
